pular ready-to-move societies.\n\n### Agarwal Residency Floor Plan\n\n| Unit Configuration | Unit Size |\n| --- | --- |\n| Agarwal Residency 2 BHK Flat | 1130 Sq. Ft. |\n To get an idea of the space covered, layout and room sizes, browsing through the floor plan would help. At Agarwal Residency you can choose from 8 configurations that are available in 3 types of floor plans or layouts. Bathrooms and balconies are a part of these configurations. You can view various layouts across different units sizes of Agarwal Residency on Magicbricks.\n\n### How is the Kandivali West Real Estate Market?\n\n For the July 2026 quarter, the average cost of multistorey apartments in Kandivali West is Rs. 20,774/sq. ft, while property values range between Rs. 15,462 and Rs. 26,086/sq. ft, offering options for varied buyer segments and investors. Rental returns for residential properties in Kandivali West, Mumbai is presently 3.25%. As per 367 user reviews, Kandivali West records an impressive rating of 4.34/5.Shopping and entertainment needs are covered with Charkop Market and Akruti Shopping Centre nearby.\n\nProject Summary is Ai Generated\n\nKey Highlights\n\nAmenities\n\nClub House\n\n★\n\nJogging and Strolling Track\n\n★\n\nCycling & Jogging Track\n\n★\n\nPower Back Up\n\nSwimming Pool\n\nLift\n\nSecurity\n\nPark\n\nReserved Parking\n\nVisitor Parking\n\nIntercom Facility\n\nMaintenance Staff\n\nBanquet Hall\n\nGymnasium\n\nIndoor Games Room\n\nFlower Gardens\n\nRain Water Harvesting\n\nRetail Boulevard (Retail Shops)\n\nWater Storage\n\nIndoor Squash & Badminton Courts\n\nMultipurpose Courts\n\nWaste Disposal\n\nOutdoor Tennis Courts\n\nEvent Space & Amphitheatre\n\nEarly Learning Centre\n\nKids Play Pool With Water Slides\n\nFire Fighting Equipment\n\nSpecifications & Key USPs of\n\nAgarwal Residency\n\nSpecifications\n\n*   Italian Marble Flooring in Living and Dining.\n*   Exclusive Wooden Flooring in Master Bedroom.\n*   Granite kitchen platform with a stainless steel sink and a service platform with full height glazed tiles on wall.\n*   Full height glazed tiles in bathroom with ceramic flooring.\n*   Wall & Ceiling of the flat will be P.O.P finished with decorative molding.\n*   Internal wall will be plastic paint.\n*   Ceiling fans & Tube lights in entire flat.\n*   Water filter in kitchen.\n*   Wooden finish kitchen cabinets with Electric chimney & 4 burner hob in kitchen.\n*   Cheesecake (Flour Mill) in the kitchen.\n*   Exhaust fan & boiler in bathroom with false ceiling.\n*   Concealed copper wiring with reputed brand switches.\n*   3 phase meter connection.\n*   Shower panel with bath tray in master bedroom.\n*   Mirror above wash basin with quality accessory fitting.\n*   Concealed Plumbing with Jaguar type fitting in Bathroom.\n*   Special water proofing treatment in bathroom & terrace.\n*   Space provision for Washing Machine.\n*   Decorative main door of solid flush door with Brass hardware fitting & double coking system and with additional safety doors.\n*   Decorative finish interior doors.\n*   Heavy section powder coated / Anodized aluminum sliding window with tinted glass and granite sill Frame.\n*   Safety grills in all windows.\n\nWhat People Say\n\nOverall\n\nPositive\n\nNeeds Improvement\n\nThe area boasts excellent connectivity, affordable transport, and proximity to essential amenities like markets, schools, and hospitals. It features a safe, well-educated community with low crime rates, well-maintained roads, parks, and recreational facilities. While affordable housing and vibrant nightlife are available, the lack of metro stations and poor road conditions lead to traffic issues. Additionally, regular power cuts and inconsistent water quality raise concerns about reliability and safety.Read Less\n\nThe area offers excellent connectivity with nearby railway stations and affordable transport options. Essential amenities such as markets, schools, hospitals, and malls are within close proximity, enhancing convenience. The community is generally kind and well-educated, contributing to a safe environment with low crime rates. The locality features well-maintained roads, parks, and recreational facilities, making it appealing for families. Affordable housing options are available, along with a vibrant nightlife and diverse food outlets.Read Less\n\nLack of nearby metro stations necessitates reliance on local trains. Road conditions are poor, with frequent traffic jams and waterlogging during monsoons. Power cuts occur regularly, particularly on Fridays, and water quality is inconsistent, leading to potential contamination issues. Public hospitals are unhygienic, and education costs are high.Read Less\n\nAI generated summary from Magicbricks reviews and on-ground insights.\n\nNearby schools\n\n Walkable markets\n\n Nearby hospitals\n\n Well-maintained roads\n\nPoor roads\n\n Nearby metro\n\n Power cuts\n\n Unhygienic\n\n## Ratings & Reviews\n\n for Agarwal Residency\n\nProject\n\nLocality\n\n4.3\n\nAverage Rating\n\n(1 Total Ratings)\n\nOverall Rating\n\n5\n\n4\n\n3\n\n2\n\n1\n\nProject Infrastructure\n\n4/5\n\nWater Supply\n\nMain Electricity\n\nPower Back Up\n\nSewage Handling\n\nProject Amenities\n\n4.5/5\n\nSports Facility\n\nParking Facility\n\nGarden of Greenery\n\nShops within Premises\n\nProject Maintenance\n\n4.5/5\n\nConstruction Quality\n\nCommon Area Maintenance\n\nAvailablity of Service\n\n24/7 Security\n\nBuyer Reviews\n\nHT\n\nHarshiil Thakkaar\n\nOwner\n\n04/06/2022\n\nNice project.\n\nThere are 2 Derasar temples nearby. Schools and colleges are within walkable distance. There is easy... Show More\n\nRating and Reviews\n\nHT\n\nHarshiil Thakkaar\n\nOwner\n\n04/06/2022\n\nNice project.\n\nThere are 2 Derasar temples nearby. Schools and colleges are within walkable distance. There is easy... Show More\n\n4.3\n\nAverage Rating\n\n(367 Total Reviews)\n\nOverall Rating\n\n5\n\n4\n\n3\n\n2\n\n1\n\nEnvironment\n\n4.4/5\n\nNeighbourhood\n\nRoads\n\nSafety\n\nCleanliness\n