n**Open;Stilt**Parking\n\nAsk about availability in Agarwal Residency\n\nAvailability, prices & floor plans across the whole building — for a specific flat, open one of the listings on this page.\n\n[💬 Enquire on WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820075868?text=Hi%2C%20I%27m%20interested%20in%20Agarwal%20Residency%20in%20Kandivali%20West.%20Please%20share%20the%20available%20units%2C%20prices%20and%20availability.) [Request details](/list-your-requirement?purpose=S&location=Kandivali%20West&source=REM%20Building%20Page) [📞 Call +91 98200 75868](tel:+919820075868)\n\n## Flats available in Agarwal Residency (2)\n\nEach card below is a separate flat in this building. Open one to see its price, photos, floor and full details. Showing the 1 most recent of 2 — WhatsApp us for the full list.\n\n[![2 BHK in Agarwal Residency](/thumb/480/projects/871_oth_14_April_2013.jpg) For Sale](/2-bhk-flat-in-kandivali-west-for-sale-in-agarwal-residency-9889436)\n\n₹ 3.3 Cr\n\n[2 BHK Agarwal Residency](/2-bhk-flat-in-kandivali-west-for-sale-in-agarwal-residency-9889436)\n\nAdded 57 days ago\n\n🛏️ 2 BHK\n\n[View](/2-bhk-flat-in-kandivali-west-for-sale-in-agarwal-residency-9889436) [💬](https://wa.me/919820075868?text=Hi%2C%20I%27m%20interested%20in%20the%20resale%202%20BHK%20at%20Agarwal%20Residency%20in%20Kandivali%20West.%20Please%20share%20the%20price%2C%20property%20details%20and%20availability.%0A%0AReference%3A%20Property%20ID%209889436)\n\n## About Agarwal Residency\n\nAgarwal Residency is one of the popular Residential Developments in Kandivali West neighborhood of Mumbai, It is among the well known Projects of Agarwal Group & its landscape is beautiful with spacious 4 Blocks Houses, it has various modern amenities like Swimming Pool, Security, Club House, Broadband Internet, Community Hall etc.\n\n## About Kandivali West\n\n\\*4 minutes from Kandivali Station. \\*2 minutes from Shoppers Stop. \\*10 minutes from Mindspace. \\*2 minutes from Orlem. \\*45 minutes from International & Domestic Airport. \\*45 minutes from Bandra Kurla Complex. \\*30 minutes from Seepz. \\*10 minutes from Lifeline Hospital. \\*5 minutes from St. Anne's Convent School & St. Joseph's High School. \\*10 minutes from Atharva Engg. College, N.L. College and Dalmiya College.\n\n## 📊 Property rates in Kandivali West\n\nApartments — buy**₹20,000–55,000/sqft**\n\n1 BHK — rent**₹25,000–55,000/mo**\n\n2 BHK — rent**₹45,000–95,000/mo**\n\n3 BHK — rent**₹75,000–1.5 Lac/mo**\n\nCommercial — lease**₹80–130/sqft**\n\n[See all Mumbai property rates →](/property-rates-in-mumbai)\n\nUpdated May 2026 · Real Estate Mumbai research\n\n## Frequently asked questions about Agarwal Residency\n\n Is this page a single flat or the whole building?\n\nThis is the building page for Agarwal Residency, Kandivali West — an overview of the building itself, not one flat for sale or rent. 2 individual flats are currently available in Agarwal Residency and are listed on this page — open any one of them for its price, photos, floor and full details.\n\n  How many flats are available in Agarwal Residency?\n\n2 verified properties are currently listed in Agarwal Residency, Kandivali West on Real Estate Mumbai — with photos, carpet area, price and RERA details.\n\n  What is the price of flats in Agarwal Residency?\n\nThe average resale price in Agarwal Residency is approximately ₹33,000,000, varying by floor, view and condition.\n\n## Nearby buildings\n\n[19 North](/19-north-kandivali-west_57206)[Panchsheel Garden](/panchsheel-garden-kandivali-west_24640)[Veena Santoor](/veena-santoor-kandivali-west_4353)[RNA Regency Park](/rna-regency-park-kandivali-west_10552)[Govardhan Nagar](/govardhan-nagar-kandivali-west_3290)[Platinum Tower](/platinum-tower-kandivali-west_11667)[Tanna Height](/tanna-height-kandivali-west_4263)[Heeraji Heritage](/heeraji-heritage-kandivali-west_57360)[Skylon Spaces](/skylon-spaces-kandivali-west_32177)[Accord Apartment](/accord-apartment-kandivali-west_2822)\n\n## Mumbai Property News\n\n