1\n* Status\n\n  Completed\n* Total Launched apartments\n\n  228\n* Launch Date\n\n  Dec'06\n* Availability\n\n  Resale\n* RERA ID\n\n  .\n\n## More about Agarwal Residency\n\nAgarwal Residency is a residential project being developed by the Agarwal Group in Mumbai’s posh suburban area of Kandivali. This project is situated at Shanker Lane which is near S.V. Road and is linked to Mumbai’s business and entertainment hubs. The project consists of 228 units. The apartments consists of 2, 3 and 4 BHK which comes with amenities such as a swimming pool, community hall, club house, jogging track and security cabin. The project offers access to Shankar Lane, Link ...View more\n\nAgarwal Residency is a residential project being developed by the Agarwal Group in Mumbai’s posh suburban area of Kandivali. This project is situated at Shanker Lane which is near S.V. Road and is linked to Mumbai’s business and entertainment hubs. The project consists of 228 units. The apartments consists of 2, 3 and 4 BHK which comes with amenities such as a swimming pool, community hall, club house, jogging track and security cabin. The project offers access to Shankar Lane, Link Road and MG Road in addition to being well linked to areas such as Kharodi and Borivali. The Bandra Kurla complex, Goregaon and Andheri can all be accessed by residents while there are several hospitals, shopping centres and educational institutions in the vicinity.  View less\n\n### Project Specifications\n\nDoors\n\nInternal:\n\nDecorative Laminate\n\nMain:\n\nDecorative Main Door\n\nFlooring\n\nBalcony:\n\nMarble Granite Tiles\n\nKitchen:\n\nWooden Flooring\n\nLiving/Dining:\n\nMarble Granite Tiles\n\nOther Bedroom:\n\nWooden Flooring\n\nToilets:\n\nWooden Flooring\n\nWalls\n\nInterior:\n\nPlastic Emulsion Paint\n\nKitchen:\n\nFull Height Designer Tiles\n\nToilets:\n\nFull Height Designer Tiles\n\nExterior:\n\nOil Bound Distemper Paint\n\nOthers\n\nWindows:\n\nAnodized Aluminium Sliding\n\nWiring:\n\nConcealed copper 